---
import { withBase } from '../utils/paths';
---

<section class="border-y border-slate-800/80 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950 via-slate-900/60 to-slate-950 py-16 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="seo-aeo-banner-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-slate-900/70 p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-2xl">
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sky-300">
            Built-In SEO + AEO (Answer Engine Optimization)
          </div>
          <h2 id="seo-aeo-banner-heading" class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-3xl">
            Engineered to Rank #1 on Google <span class="text-sky-400">and</span> Be Cited First by ChatGPT, Perplexity &amp; Gemini
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
            Decision-makers no longer just search 10 blue links—they ask AI Answer Engines for vendor comparisons,
            ERPNext &amp; POS implementation partners, and OCR accuracy benchmarks. Jobshore builds every web asset with a dual
            <strong class="text-white">Technical SEO + Entity-First AEO</strong> architecture.
          </p>

          <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 pt-2 text-xs">
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 p-3.5">
              <div class="font-bold text-sky-300">1. Multi-Entity JSON-LD @graph</div>
              <p class="mt-1 text-slate-400">
                Linked <code class="text-slate-200">Organization</code>, <code class="text-slate-200">ITService</code>,
                <code class="text-slate-200">OfferCatalog</code> (all 5 Service Pillars), <code class="text-slate-200">SpeakableSpecification</code>, and
                <code class="text-slate-200">FAQPage</code> schemas for zero-ambiguity entity resolution.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 p-3.5">
              <div class="font-bold text-emerald-300">2. Native /llms.txt &amp; /llms-full.txt</div>
              <p class="mt-1 text-slate-400">
                Dedicated machine-readable Markdown endpoints for <code class="text-slate-200">OAI-SearchBot</code>,
                <code class="text-slate-200">PerplexityBot</code>, and <code class="text-slate-200">ClaudeBot</code>.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 p-3.5">
              <div class="font-bold text-indigo-300">3. Direct-Answer Capsules &amp; Tables</div>
              <p class="mt-1 text-slate-400">
                Semantic <code class="text-slate-200">&lt;aside class="aeo-summary"&gt;</code>, <code class="text-slate-200">&lt;dl&gt;</code>, and
                <code class="text-slate-200">&lt;table&gt;</code> matrices designed for AI snippet extraction.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/80 p-3.5">
              <div class="font-bold text-violet-300">4. GitHub Pages + Custom Domain Ready</div>
              <p class="mt-1 text-slate-400">
                Static HTML-first Astro build configured for instant <code class="text-slate-200">GitHub Pages</code> hosting now and seamless custom domain cutover later.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right Column: Live Verification Card -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-5 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-800 pb-3">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-300">
              Live Site SEO &amp; AEO Telemetry
            </span>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-emerald-400">
              ALL CHECKS PASSED
            </span>
          </div>

          <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs font-mono">
            <li class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-3 py-2">
              <span class="text-slate-300">JSON-LD @graph Entities</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓ Active in &lt;head&gt;</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-3 py-2">
              <span class="text-slate-300">SpeakableSpecification</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓ .aeo-summary Bound</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-3 py-2">
              <span class="text-slate-300">LLM Knowledge Index</span>
              <a href={withBase('/llms.txt')} target="_blank" class="text-sky-400 underline hover:text-sky-300">/llms.txt (200 OK)</a>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-3 py-2">
              <span class="text-slate-300">Full LLM Spec Sheet</span>
              <a href={withBase('/llms-full.txt')} target="_blank" class="text-sky-400 underline hover:text-sky-300">/llms-full.txt (200 OK)</a>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-3 py-2">
              <span class="text-slate-300">AI Crawler Policy</span>
              <a href={withBase('/robots.txt')} target="_blank" class="text-sky-400 underline hover:text-sky-300">/robots.txt (Allowed)</a>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <button
            type="button"
            data-open-seo-modal
            class="w-full rounded-xl border border-sky-500/40 bg-sky-500/15 px-4 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-sky-300 transition hover:bg-sky-500/25 cursor-pointer"
          >
            Open Live JSON-LD Schema &amp; AEO Inspector
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
